   "notes": "NEON Domain D09 (Northern Plains) terrestrial site; D09 support facility in Jamestown, ND. Site host: Chase Lake National Wildlife Refuge (USFWS, https://www.fws.gov/refuge/chase_lake/); no host staff named on the NEON page. Colocated: Prairie Pothole (PRPO) aquatic site, NADP, CZEN, AmeriFlux US-xWD. AmeriFlux lists the PI as the NEON program (an institution, not a person); the four named flux/data contacts are NEON-HQ staff shared across NEON towers, so they are attached at medium confidence and not as key personnel."
  },
