   "notes": "NEON Domain D12 (Northern Rockies) terrestrial site; D12 support facility in Bozeman, MT. Site host: Yellowstone National Park (NPS); research permits through IRMA. Park leadership is recorded on the colocated Yellowstone Biosphere Reserve facility, not repeated here. Colocated: Blacktail Deer Creek (BLDE) aquatic site, NADP Tower Falls, CZEN, AmeriFlux US-xYE. AmeriFlux PI is the NEON program itself; flux/data contacts are NEON-HQ staff. Several ORCID records named Amy Jacobs exist, none tied to NEON, so no ORCID assigned."
  },
