   "notes": "NEON Domain D11 (Southern Plains) terrestrial site; D11 support facility in Denton, TX. Site host: Caddo-LBJ National Grasslands (USFS, Decatur, TX ranger district); NEON page asks researchers not to contact the host and to coordinate through the D11 manager. Colocated: Pringle Creek (PRIN) aquatic site, CZEN, AmeriFlux US-xCL. Joe Buck's ORCID employment record shows NEON Domain Manager from 2025. The USFS district pages fetched name no staff, so the existing recall-sourced 'Bob Wells' row could not be found; a web search also turned up nothing linking that name to the grassland."
